WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.748
Today both letters are in the same path of words.

2
00:00:03.198 --> 00:00:10.011
Watch first. The first one on the page is done for you: show it, do the next one together, and your child does the rest.

3
00:00:10.511 --> 00:00:13.090
Watch first. Then do the same with your child.

4
00:00:13.590 --> 00:00:18.016
Each word is the same as the one before, with one letter changed. Watch.

5
00:00:21.313 --> 00:00:22.323
The word is bad.

6
00:00:26.165 --> 00:00:27.189
The word is dad.

7
00:00:30.887 --> 00:00:31.895
The word is did.

8
00:00:32.795 --> 00:00:36.774
On the page, cover the word with your finger. Show it one letter at a time.

9
00:00:37.224 --> 00:00:42.360
If your child mixes the two letters up, do not say the answer. Say: check with the bed.

10
00:00:42.810 --> 00:00:45.634
Let them find it. That is the habit you are building.

11
00:00:46.084 --> 00:00:51.849
Read the path together once. Then press play on the listening track for job two, and step away.
